We've identified a CCA convoy carrying the relic to a Southern launch pad. We must take advantage of having the CCA on the run and make sure that we capture the relic.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Rendezvous with NSDF MUF.
- Destroy all CCA Artillery.
- Capture the convoy and relic.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
Our engineers have tooled the MUF to duplicate the walker technology that we saw the CCA using in your last mission. These new units will bring unrivaled firepower to the battlefield, but unfortunately they are so heavy that they can no longer hover or move nimbly.
